<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Himanshu | Developer Portfolio</title>

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#070711;
    color:#fff;
}
nav{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;
    width:100%;
    padding:20px 8%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    background:#070711dd;
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    z-index:10;
}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:bold;color:#a855f7}
nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin-left:25px;
}
nav a:hover{color:#22d3ee}

section{
    min-height:100vh;
    padding:110px 8% 60px;
}

.hero{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:40px;
    background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%,#7c3aed44,transparent 35%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 20% 70%,#06b6d433,transparent 30%);
}
.hero-text{max-width:650px}
.hero h1{
    font-size:55px;
    line-height:1.1;
}
.hero h1 span{
    color:#a855f7;
}
.hero p{
    margin:20px 0;
    font-size:20px;
    color:#bbb;
}
.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:13px 25px;
    margin:8px;
    border-radius:30px;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:white;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7c3aed,#06b6d4);
}
.photo{
    width:300px;
    height:300px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:5px solid #a855f7;
    box-shadow:0 0 50px #7c3aed;
}

.title{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:40px;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}
.title span{color:#a855f7}

.about{
    max-width:850px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;
    color:#bbb;
    font-size:18px;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.skills,.projects,.goals{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}
.card{
    background:#11111d;
    padding:30px;
    border:1px solid #292943;
    border-radius:20px;
    text-align:center;
    transition:.3s;
}
.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
    border-color:#a855f7;
    box-shadow:0 0 25px #7c3aed55;
}
.card h3{
    color:#22d3ee;
    margin-bottom:12px;
}
.card p{color:#aaa;line-height:1.6}

.contact{
    text-align:center;
}
.contact a{
    display:inline-block;
    margin:10px;
    padding:15px 25px;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#151525;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid #33334d;
}
.contact a:hover{
    border-color:#22d3ee;
    color:#22d3ee;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    color:#777;
    border-top:1px solid #222;
}

@media(max-width:800px){
    nav div:last-child{display:none}
    .hero{
        flex-direction:column-reverse;
        text-align:center;
        padding-top:130px;
    }
    .hero h1{font-size:40px}
    .photo{
        width:220px;
        height:220px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">HIMANSHU.</div>
    <div>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Hi, I'm <span>Himanshu</span></h1>
        <p>Full Stack Developer & AI Enthusiast 🚀</p>
        <p>Building modern websites, learning AI/ML and creating amazing projects.</p>

        <a class="btn" href="#projects">View Projects</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact Me</a>
    </div>

    <img src="himanshu.jpg" class="photo" alt="Himanshu">
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2 class="title">About <span>Me</span></h2>

    <div class="about">
        <p>
            I'm Himanshu, a CSEIML student passionate about
            coding, artificial intelligence, web development and technology.
            My goal is to keep learning, build real-world projects
            and become a skilled AI/ML developer.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
    <h2 class="title">My <span>Skills</span></h2>

    <div class="skills">
        <div class="card"><h3>C</h3><p>Programming fundamentals</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>C++</h3><p>Problem solving & OOP</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Python</h3><p>AI & programming</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Java</h3><p>Programming & applications</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>HTML</h3><p>Website structure</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>CSS</h3><p>Modern web design</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>JavaScript</h3><p>Interactive websites</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>MySQL</h3><p>Database management</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <h2 class="title">My <span>Projects</span></h2>

    <div class="projects">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Personal Portfolio</h3>
            <p>My personal developer portfolio website.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>AI Chatbot</h3>
            <p>Learning to build intelligent AI applications.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Game Project</h3>
            <p>Experimenting with gaming and interactive projects.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Mobile App</h3>
            <p>Future Android application project.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="goals">
    <h2 class="title">My <span>Goals</span></h2>

    <div class="goals">
        <div class="card"><h3>🎓 BTech</h3><p>Complete CSEIML successfully.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>🤖 AI/ML</h3><p>Become an AI/ML expert.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>💻 Projects</h3><p>Build real-world projects.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>🌎 Future</h3><p>Build a successful career.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2 class="title">Contact <span>Me</span></h2>

    <p style="color:#aaa;margin-bottom:25px">
        Let's connect and build something awesome.
    </p>

    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/itz_prime_happy" target="_blank">
        📸 Instagram
    </a>

    <a href="tel:+919204770065">
        📞 Call Me
    </a>

    <a href="https://wa.me/919204770065" target="_blank">
        💬 WhatsApp
    </a>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Himanshu. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
